  "description": "The \u0027scenario_run_cached\u0027 dataset provides detailed information about various scenario runs, capturing essential metadata such as project keys, scenario identifiers, and execution timestamps. This dataset is particularly useful for tracking and analyzing the performance and outcomes of different scenarios over time. Each entry in the dataset includes a unique scenario project key and scenario ID, which help in identifying and categorizing the scenarios. The dataset also records the start and end times of each scenario run, allowing for precise calculation of run durations. Additionally, it includes the outcome of each run, which is crucial for performance analysis and troubleshooting. The dataset also tracks the number of warnings generated during each run, providing insights into potential issues or areas for improvement. User-related information, such as the user who ran the scenario and their identifier, is also included, which can be useful for auditing and accountability purposes. Overall, this dataset is a valuable resource for project managers, developers, and analysts who need to monitor and optimize scenario executions.",
  "shortDesc": "Dataset of scenario run details with timestamps and outcomes.",
